      "style": "Normal"
    },
    {
      "para_index": 54,
      "text": "3.1. UI \u0111\u1eb9p ph\u1ea3i \u0111i c\u00f9ng t\u00ednh nh\u1ea5t qu\u00e1n",
      "style": "Normal"
    },
    {
      "para_index": 56,
      "text": "3.2. C\u1ea3i thi\u1ec7n UI c\u1ea7n ki\u1ec3m so\u00e1t h\u1ed3i quy",
      "style": "Normal"
    },
    {
      "para_index": 58,
      "text": "3.3. AI n\u00ean l\u00e0 c\u00f4ng c\u1ee5 h\u1ed7 tr\u1ee3 thay v\u00ec quy\u1ebft \u0111\u1ecbnh thay ng\u01b0\u1eddi d\u00f9ng",
      "style": "Normal"
    },
    {
      "para_index": 60,
      "text": "3.4. C\u1ea7n t\u00e1ch l\u1edbp t\u00edch h\u1ee3p AI kh\u1ecfi giao di\u1ec7n",
      "style": "Normal"
    },
    {
      "para_index": 62,
      "text": "3.5. Ki\u1ec3m th\u1eed t\u1ef1 \u0111\u1ed9ng v\u00e0 ki\u1ec3m th\u1eed th\u1ee7 c\u00f4ng b\u1ed5 sung cho nhau",
      "style": "Normal"
    },
    {
      "para_index": 64,
      "text": "4. Lu\u1ed3ng ho\u1ea1t \u0111\u1ed9ng c\u1ee7a t\u00ednh n\u0103ng g\u1ee3i \u00fd caption",
      "style": "Normal"
    },
    {
      "para_index": 72,
      "text": "5. Kh\u00f3 kh\u0103n v\u00e0 c\u00e1ch x\u1eed l\u00fd",
      "style": "Normal"
    },
    {
      "para_index": 77,
      "text": "6. M\u1ee9c \u0111\u1ed9 ho\u00e0n thi\u1ec7n",
      "style": "Normal"
    },
    {
      "para_index": 79,
      "text": "7. H\u1ea1n ch\u1ebf hi\u1ec7n t\u1ea1i v\u00e0 h\u01b0\u1edbng ph\u00e1t tri\u1ec3n",
      "style": "Normal"
    },
    {
      "para_index": 87,
      "text": "8. Bi\u1ec3u \u0111\u1ed3 lu\u1ed3ng AI v\u00e0 quy tr\u00ecnh ki\u1ec3m th\u1eed",
      "style": "Normal"
    },
